  "context": [
    "Ongoing: Vent path sizing and cell spacing to contain a single-cell runaway. This week: Rev B: larger vent channel, mica sheets, spacing stays 2 mm.",
    "Ongoing: FOC rewrite with a thermal model and derating for DVT actuators",
